  <p id="c-epitaph-wenqiao-excerpts:sons" annotation-status="reviewed" text-layer="epitaph_as_modernly_transcribed">使持節侍中大將軍始安忠武公并州太原祁縣都鄉仁義里<persName id="c-epitaph-wenqiao-excerpts:sons:m0024" ref="6v8_pk9_7k5">溫嶠</persName>字<persName id="c-epitaph-wenqiao-excerpts:sons:m0027" ref="6v8_pk9_7k5">泰真</persName>年卌二夫人高平李氏夫人琅耶<persName id="c-epitaph-wenqiao-excerpts:sons:m0042" ref="qvj_q3k_jzn">王氏</persName>夫人廬江<persName id="c-epitaph-wenqiao-excerpts:sons:m0048" ref="6zi_1oz_jik">何氏</persName>息<persName id="c-epitaph-wenqiao-excerpts:sons:m0051" ref="6v8_pk9_7k5_A">放之</persName>字<persName id="c-epitaph-wenqiao-excerpts:sons:m0054" ref="6v8_pk9_7k5_A">弘祖</persName>息<persName id="c-epitaph-wenqiao-excerpts:sons:m0057" ref="6v8_pk9_7k5_B">式之</persName>字<persName id="c-epitaph-wenqiao-excerpts:sons:m0060" ref="6v8_pk9_7k5_B">穆祖</persName></p>
</text>
